msgctxt "HowToPage:1393:0:4"
msgid "The <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Party Finder</ui-edge-color></ui-color> has been added to the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Party</ui-edge-color></ui-color> section of the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>main menu</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Through the Party Finder, you can either search for a party to join, or recruit other adventurers to form a party of your own."
msgstr "В разделе <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Группа»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>главного меню</ui-edge-color></ui-color> появился <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Поиск группы»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. С его помощью можно найти группу или набрать искателей приключений в свою."

#. ja: 採集をしていると<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「埋蔵品」（HIDDEN）</ui-edge-color></ui-color>に<br>出会うことがあります。<br><br><br><br><br><br><br>　　　　　　　　　　　次のページへ》
#. de: Sammler stoßen manchmal zufällig auf <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verborgene Gegenstände</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
#. fr: Lors de leurs opérations de récolte, il peut arriver que les disciples de la terre découvrent des <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>objets cachés</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
